flowchart TD
  Entry[Block 0: entry and verified preheader] --> Header[Block 1: loop condition and phis]
  Header --> Body[Block 2: body]
  Body --> Step[Block 3: induction step]
  Step --> Header
  Header --> Exit[Block 4: return]
  Body -. unsigned x times 9 moves with its SSA ID .-> Entry
  Header -. induction phi remains .-> Header
  Body -. dependent accumulator remains .-> Body
